<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 229-5 AT STUMPS ON 1ST DAY VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 229-5 AT STUMPS ON 1ST DAY VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 229 for the loss of five wickets at stumps on the first day of their third and final cricket test against England on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 229 for five wickets (S. Fleming 62, R. Croft 3-49).</p>
